                    <item name="Text" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Define parametric logic for the user interface.

In this app, users are able to upload a file containing a curve defining the tower's floor plan.

The file upload parameter is always shown in the interface, but we test if a curve exists before showing the other App parameters.</item>
